| logical_plan  | Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |  Projection: sum(snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_EXTENDEDPRICE) / Float64(7) AS AVG_YEARLY                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |   Aggregate: groupBy=[[]], aggr=[[sum(snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_EXTENDEDPRICE)]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |     Inner Join:  Filter: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.PART.P_PARTKEY = snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_PARTKEY                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |       Filter: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_QUANTITY < (<subquery>)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |         Subquery:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |           Projection: Float64(0.2) * avg(snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_QUANTITY)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |             Aggregate: groupBy=[[]], aggr=[[avg(snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_QUANTITY)]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |               Filter: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_PARTKEY = outer_ref(snowflake.TPCH_SF1.PART.P_PARTKEY)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |                 TableScan: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
