|               |       TableScan: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.PART projection=[P_PARTKEY], full_filters=[snowflake.TPCH_SF1.PART.P_BRAND = Utf8("Brand#23"), snowflake.TPCH_SF1.PART.P_CONTAINER = Utf8("MED BOX")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
